              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kĩkw’ũ kũkanyuvwa kũte thayũ nĩ ũtialo w’onthe ũla wĩtiala wa mũvĩa ũũ mũthũku, ala metiala kũndũ kw’onthe kũla namalũngĩlĩĩlye, easya ũu Yeova wa nguthu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
